WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:33.939
[Episode 23]

01:33.959 --> 01:35.620
Put the little things inside.

01:35.640 --> 01:36.379
Put them inside.

01:36.399 --> 01:36.939
Go now.

01:36.959 --> 01:38.880
Go to my father's place
and bring Dabao here.

01:39.679 --> 01:41.440
We should leave some space for Dabao.

01:43.080 --> 01:44.160
No!

01:46.159 --> 01:47.679
You can't touch that.

01:51.000 --> 01:53.000
Dabao is inside.

01:53.440 --> 01:54.700
Dabao, don't be afraid.

01:54.720 --> 01:55.700
He's not a bad guy.

01:55.720 --> 01:57.240
I know that.

01:57.599 --> 01:59.640
How many delicacies has Dabao consumed?

01:59.640 --> 02:00.640
Look at how bloated it looks.

02:00.640 --> 02:01.579
It's going to explode.

02:01.599 --> 02:03.199
- It's a glutton.
- Wang.

02:03.800 --> 02:05.030
Mr. Fan, let me do it.

02:09.279 --> 02:10.359
No.

02:10.399 --> 02:12.120
You mustn't touch that as well.

02:12.519 --> 02:14.659
Do you know what's inside?

02:14.679 --> 02:15.580
Listen.

02:15.600 --> 02:18.539
These are the hawthorns
my father gave me.

02:18.559 --> 02:19.480
They're delicious.

02:19.500 --> 02:22.150
Your father gave you these hawthorns
to aid in your digestion, huh?

02:24.239 --> 02:25.419
What's wrong with you?

02:25.439 --> 02:26.659
I told you already.

02:26.679 --> 02:27.979
You mustn't touch it.

02:27.999 --> 02:28.780
Give it to me.

02:28.800 --> 02:30.160
Dabao, don't be afraid.

02:30.160 --> 02:30.600
It's fine.

02:30.600 --> 02:31.659
He's not a bad guy.

02:31.679 --> 02:33.239
Dabao had its fill already.

02:35.119 --> 02:36.450
Father gave these to me.

02:36.470 --> 02:38.219
These are the hawthorns
my father gave me.

02:38.239 --> 02:39.659
Yeah. They aid in your digestion.

02:39.679 --> 02:40.759
That's right.

02:42.239 --> 02:43.539
I told you already.

02:43.559 --> 02:45.840
Don't touch it.

02:46.320 --> 02:48.140
This is Dabao's Dabao.

02:48.160 --> 02:49.240
Okay.

02:49.279 --> 02:50.359
Got it.

02:58.366 --> 02:59.925
Put it for me.

03:00.559 --> 03:01.639
Where should I...

03:05.480 --> 03:06.460
Young Master.

03:06.480 --> 03:07.959
Don't tire yourself out.

03:08.200 --> 03:09.460
Don't be scared.

03:09.480 --> 03:10.959
Dabao, don't be scared.

03:27.439 --> 03:28.939
Except for you, Father!

03:28.959 --> 03:30.680
Except for you, Father!

03:31.519 --> 03:32.900
Except for you, Father!

03:32.920 --> 03:34.799
Except for you, Father!

03:36.439 --> 03:38.600
Except for you, Father!

03:41.040 --> 03:42.440
Dabao!

03:50.959 --> 03:52.799
Except for you, Father!

03:56.600 --> 04:01.320
[Fan's Residence]

04:10.719 --> 04:11.840
Shi Chanli.

04:14.360 --> 04:15.479
Shi Chanli?

04:16.600 --> 04:17.800
Shi Chanli?

04:53.360 --> 04:54.440
Shi Chanli.

04:57.280 --> 04:58.399
Mr. Fan,

04:59.199 --> 05:00.800
according to the disaster report,

05:01.320 --> 05:03.159
it stated that it was an accidental fire

05:03.319 --> 05:04.839
caused by the dry weather.

05:09.720 --> 05:11.199
But Mr. Fan, something's off.

05:11.840 --> 05:13.199
If it's a natural disaster,

05:13.520 --> 05:14.960
it needs a source.

05:14.980 --> 05:17.100
Even if the wind is strong
and the fire is urgent,

05:17.280 --> 05:19.739
it's impossible for a town
to be burned down in an instant.

05:19.759 --> 05:21.099
Even if the town is burned down,

05:21.119 --> 05:22.279
not all

05:23.480 --> 05:25.560
of its townsfolk would die from it.

05:29.600 --> 05:31.480
I understand all of that.

05:32.200 --> 05:34.100
I'm sure the person
who wrote this report

05:34.840 --> 05:36.120
knew this too.

05:47.119 --> 05:48.880
An entire town,

05:49.559 --> 05:50.880
and a fire like this,

05:53.119 --> 05:54.800
and this is all I get?

05:58.600 --> 06:00.279
When my men rushed there,

06:01.879 --> 06:03.910
the town was already
burned to the ground.

06:05.400 --> 06:06.800
None of them survived.

06:07.999 --> 06:10.480
Chengze is too ruthless.

06:12.999 --> 06:14.920
The town was burned to the ground.

06:14.990 --> 06:17.240
And, we have lost our leads
about his smuggling deals.

06:17.559 --> 06:19.900
The thing is,
many innocent people died for nothing!

06:19.920 --> 06:21.440
The town is gone.

06:21.800 --> 06:23.599
They need to give us an account somehow.

06:23.960 --> 06:25.360
An accidental fire.

06:26.679 --> 06:27.959
Is that all?

06:31.040 --> 06:32.920
Mr. Fan, this may be presumptuous of me,

06:34.160 --> 06:35.959
but the person who set the town on fire,

06:38.119 --> 06:40.240
is he an influential figure?

06:43.280 --> 06:44.880
Now, we still don't know

06:44.920 --> 06:46.410
the identity of the culprit.

06:46.430 --> 06:47.970
However, your conclusion is correct.

06:47.990 --> 06:49.199
It's surely someone

06:49.679 --> 06:51.040
wealthy and influential.

06:51.239 --> 06:52.319
If so...

06:55.319 --> 06:57.560
If so, can we still
investigate the case?

07:02.199 --> 07:03.399
Did you know?

07:04.840 --> 07:06.739
I received another murder report

07:06.759 --> 07:08.519
just today.

07:09.119 --> 07:10.480
But just now,

07:11.520 --> 07:12.639
the case was gone.

07:12.679 --> 07:13.750
What do you mean by that?

07:13.770 --> 07:15.660
The plaintiffs rescinded their charges.

07:16.600 --> 07:17.759
Shi Chanli,

07:17.800 --> 07:19.380
in these present times,

07:19.400 --> 07:21.650
it's hard to establish a case
if the victims aren't willing

07:21.670 --> 07:23.520
to press charges against the culprits.

07:24.360 --> 07:25.440
Mr. Fan!

07:25.639 --> 07:27.020
I wish to track down the culprit!

07:27.040 --> 07:28.140
Will you retreat, then?

07:28.160 --> 07:30.619
Mr. Fan, my entire family is gone!

07:30.639 --> 07:32.839
Where can I retreat to?

07:37.720 --> 07:38.800
All right.

07:39.639 --> 07:40.940
I'll take on your case.

07:40.960 --> 07:42.020
Not only that,

07:42.040 --> 07:43.120
but I'll also

07:43.319 --> 07:44.719
take you under my wing.

07:44.800 --> 07:46.820
From now on, you're my retainer.

07:46.840 --> 07:48.040
For this case, I cannot guarantee

07:48.040 --> 07:49.160
that I'll give you a result soon.

07:49.160 --> 07:50.480
But I promise you this.

07:50.999 --> 07:53.079
I'll keep on investigating the case.

07:55.439 --> 07:58.240
Mr. Fan, I, Shi Chanli,
am willing to serve you with my life!

08:02.275 --> 08:06.470
[Imperial Procuratorate]

08:31.199 --> 08:32.520
Seniors,

08:33.280 --> 08:35.579
I'm He Zongwei.

08:35.599 --> 08:37.986
Thanks to His Majesty's grace,

08:38.006 --> 08:40.766
I'll be one of the censors
starting from today.

08:40.839 --> 08:43.440
Seniors, please guide me in the future.

08:53.110 --> 08:54.790
Here's a gift for our first meeting.

08:55.320 --> 08:56.699
Here's a gift for our first meeting.

08:56.719 --> 08:58.760
It's nothing valuable. Please accept it.

09:00.150 --> 09:01.760
Please guide me in the future.

09:05.510 --> 09:07.070
Please guide me in the future.

09:08.319 --> 09:10.830
Senior, please guide me in the future.

09:11.040 --> 09:12.400
Are you giving us gifts?

09:13.359 --> 09:14.439
No.

09:15.520 --> 09:16.879
I know clearly

09:16.920 --> 09:17.840
that as imperial censors,

09:17.860 --> 09:18.640
we're responsible for

09:18.640 --> 09:21.520
purging the administration
and impeaching the officials.

09:22.160 --> 09:24.659
Giving gifts and bribes are taboos.

09:24.679 --> 09:25.999
We must never do so.

09:26.280 --> 09:27.360
However,

09:27.439 --> 09:28.920
seniors, don't worry.

09:29.326 --> 09:32.819
These are just snacks
I bought on my way here.

09:32.839 --> 09:34.520
And, they're the cheapest snacks too.

09:34.760 --> 09:35.970
They're just tokens

09:35.990 --> 09:37.239
of my appreciation.

09:40.640 --> 09:43.239
Senior, please
distribute this to everyone.

09:54.240 --> 09:55.560
Senior,

09:56.559 --> 09:59.800
is this the seat
of the late Mr. Lai Mingcheng?

10:11.000 --> 10:12.080
Senior,

10:12.150 --> 10:13.020
do you have a match?

10:13.040 --> 10:14.270
Please light it for me.

10:14.320 --> 10:15.640
What are you trying to do?

10:17.839 --> 10:18.999
To be honest,

10:21.319 --> 10:23.119
Mr. Lai Mingcheng

10:23.679 --> 10:25.879
was my guiding light before this.

10:27.040 --> 10:28.640
Although we never met before,

10:29.079 --> 10:30.800
to me,

10:31.160 --> 10:33.440
he's my mentor and a friend.

10:34.760 --> 10:36.320
When Mr. Lai died,

10:38.640 --> 10:40.640
I was deeply disheartened
by his passing.

10:41.000 --> 10:43.179
Now that I'm seeing the seat he used
when he was alive,

10:43.199 --> 10:45.320
I have to pray to it.

10:46.120 --> 10:47.040
What are you doing?

10:47.040 --> 10:49.020
You can't just do that
in the Imperial Procuratorate.

10:49.040 --> 10:49.679
Don't do this. Get up.

10:49.679 --> 10:50.939
Hurry and get up. Don't do this.

10:50.959 --> 10:53.260
Mr. He, hurry and get up.

10:53.280 --> 10:53.819
That's right.

10:53.839 --> 10:55.040
I was too agitated.

11:11.800 --> 11:12.880
By the way,

11:13.230 --> 11:15.119
I had no official position before this.

11:15.200 --> 11:16.500
I only knew that Mr. Lai passed away.

11:16.520 --> 11:18.079
I know not of the reason.

11:18.800 --> 11:20.560
Was there any treachery involved?

11:22.120 --> 11:23.719
So you have no idea, huh?

11:24.599 --> 11:25.900
Mr. Lai passed away

11:25.920 --> 11:28.280
all because he impeached Fan Xian.

11:28.319 --> 11:31.760
He was the one who supervised
his punishment as well.

11:33.920 --> 11:35.199
It was actually him?

11:35.839 --> 11:37.999
I actually visited that crook
before this.

11:39.960 --> 11:41.380
You were ignorant in the past.

11:41.400 --> 11:42.380
This isn't your fault.

11:42.400 --> 11:43.179
In the future,

11:43.199 --> 11:44.380
just stay away from him.

11:44.400 --> 11:45.480
This won't do.

11:45.880 --> 11:48.320
How could I retreat
in the face of such crooks?

11:48.560 --> 11:49.699
I'll head to Fan's Residence now.

11:49.719 --> 11:50.920
I'll reason with him!

11:53.925 --> 11:56.295
[Fan's Residence]

12:00.240 --> 12:03.320
Buddy, do you have a knife?

12:04.839 --> 12:05.860
No.

12:05.880 --> 12:07.440
Can you lend me one?

12:08.920 --> 12:09.760
I'm new to the place too.

12:09.760 --> 12:11.360
I'm not familiar with the place.

12:26.439 --> 12:27.599
Lend this to me.

12:36.599 --> 12:37.679
Thanks.

12:58.640 --> 12:59.920
What did you tell him?

13:00.479 --> 13:02.640
Mr. Fan, I hereby request punishment.

13:03.280 --> 13:05.020
Mr. Fan, please punish me.

13:05.040 --> 13:06.199
He Zongwei.

13:07.040 --> 13:08.660
Now, you're a censor.

13:08.680 --> 13:10.620
How could an official like you kneel
without any reason?

13:10.640 --> 13:11.819
Mr. Fan, please spare me.

13:11.839 --> 13:13.840
Since when did I say
I wanted to take your life?

13:14.099 --> 13:15.179
Mr. Fan,

13:15.670 --> 13:17.439
before this, I brought up
the spring exam murder case

13:17.439 --> 13:18.959
in front of you.

13:19.120 --> 13:21.640
I offended you back then.

13:21.679 --> 13:22.759
Mr. Fan,

13:22.800 --> 13:24.839
you know my character well.

13:25.280 --> 13:26.760
I do.

13:27.199 --> 13:29.870
Mr. Fan, when it comes to literature,

13:29.959 --> 13:31.339
your talent knows no bounds.

13:31.359 --> 13:33.780
When it comes to officialdom,
you have several positions,

13:33.800 --> 13:34.830
and you're very influential.

13:34.850 --> 13:36.460
When it comes to relationships,

13:37.160 --> 13:39.020
Mr. Fan, you're my godfather.

13:39.040 --> 13:39.940
Don't say that.

13:39.960 --> 13:41.599
I don't have a cheap son like you.

13:42.199 --> 13:42.939
He Zongwei,

13:42.959 --> 13:44.160
I know you're just a tool.

13:44.160 --> 13:45.299
I don't plan to take revenge on you.

13:45.319 --> 13:46.400
Get up and scram.

13:47.240 --> 13:48.320
Mr. Fan,

13:49.120 --> 13:50.540
please beat me up

13:50.560 --> 13:52.070
and vent your frustrations.

13:54.079 --> 13:55.059
Why don't you

13:55.079 --> 13:57.239
tell your subordinate
to do it on your behalf?

14:02.319 --> 14:04.119
So you're here to ask for a beating?

14:05.599 --> 14:06.679
Mr. Fan,

14:07.280 --> 14:09.079
after Lai Mingcheng's passing,

14:09.169 --> 14:10.659
the entire Imperial Procuratorate

14:10.679 --> 14:12.680
sees you as their enemy now.

14:12.959 --> 14:14.959
If you beat me up,

14:15.527 --> 14:17.086
it'll be easier for me

14:17.400 --> 14:18.959
to be a censor in the future.

14:21.400 --> 14:23.680
You're here to seek patronage, huh?

14:25.120 --> 14:26.800
Mr. Fan, it'll be worth it.

14:27.200 --> 14:28.939
Now that I'm
in the Imperial Procuratorate,

14:28.959 --> 14:30.699
I can notify you in secret

14:30.719 --> 14:32.760
if anything were to happen
in the future.

14:36.160 --> 14:37.140
Mr. Fan,

14:37.160 --> 14:39.459
I have no power and no one to depend on.

14:39.479 --> 14:41.459
I'm just struggling to survive.

14:41.479 --> 14:43.160
Mr. Fan, sorry for the embarrassment.

14:45.270 --> 14:46.479
See our guest off.

14:50.719 --> 14:51.920
See him off.

14:53.959 --> 14:56.620
Mr. Fan, please beat me up.

14:56.640 --> 14:58.440
If not, at least you should hit me once.

14:58.479 --> 14:59.560
Please.

15:03.800 --> 15:04.880
All right.

15:09.760 --> 15:10.840
Mr. Fan.

15:10.920 --> 15:12.160
You're benevolent.

15:30.110 --> 15:31.479
Buddy, what's your name?

15:32.319 --> 15:33.640
I don't practice violence.

15:36.280 --> 15:37.999
Are you Mr. Fan's retainer?

15:39.959 --> 15:41.160
I failed the exam.

15:43.959 --> 15:45.340
That's good as well.

15:45.360 --> 15:47.539
If you don't strive hard
after getting into officialdom,

15:47.559 --> 15:48.959
you'll still have no future.

15:51.920 --> 15:53.879
You're still young.

16:01.000 --> 16:03.300
Seems like He Zongwei is trying
to build a connection here,

16:03.320 --> 16:05.079
but he overstepped his boundaries.

16:05.479 --> 16:06.299
When did you arrive?

16:06.319 --> 16:07.539
I arrived long ago.

16:07.559 --> 16:08.620
You were busy.

16:08.640 --> 16:09.780
I dared not interrupt you.

16:09.800 --> 16:11.000
Do you need anything?

16:16.070 --> 16:18.419
[Imperial Inspectorate Fifth Division
Black Cavalries Transfer Records]

16:18.439 --> 16:20.059
Has Mr. Wuzhu been here lately?

16:20.079 --> 16:21.100
No.

16:21.120 --> 16:21.860
Mr. Fan,

16:21.880 --> 16:24.780
I heard that you're
Mr. Wuzhu's disciple.

16:24.800 --> 16:26.260
If Mr. Wuzhu isn't around,

16:26.280 --> 16:29.199
I guess sparring with you
is the same thing.

16:29.520 --> 16:30.459
Just ignore him.

16:30.479 --> 16:31.999
He's a martial arts fanatic.

16:32.040 --> 16:33.999
He always wants to spar with Wuzhu.

16:34.470 --> 16:36.079
Let's get down to business first.

16:42.479 --> 16:44.839
You should know about
the Fifth Division.

16:45.160 --> 16:45.599
I do.

16:45.599 --> 16:46.939
They're in charge of
the Black Cavalries.

16:46.959 --> 16:48.039
That's right.

16:49.400 --> 16:52.620
The Black Cavalries have always been
stationed outside the Capital.

16:52.640 --> 16:54.260
However, the supply of grain and fodder

16:54.280 --> 16:56.420
has always been
allocated by the Capital.

16:56.440 --> 16:57.473
Therefore, it's inevitable that

16:57.474 --> 16:59.140
the First Division
has to help with the task.

16:59.160 --> 17:02.370
Here is a record of
the resource allocation over the years

17:02.390 --> 17:04.460
and the mobilization
of the Black Cavalries.

17:04.480 --> 17:06.000
Read it thoroughly.

17:06.159 --> 17:07.500
In the future,

17:07.520 --> 17:08.919
you should handle this.

17:09.760 --> 17:11.899
You could've sent your subordinate here
to notify me.

17:11.919 --> 17:13.180
Why did you come here personally?

17:13.200 --> 17:15.240
The Black Cavalries

17:15.319 --> 17:16.980
isn't under the military's control.

17:17.000 --> 17:19.960
Only one person in the entire Qing State
can mobilize the Black Cavalries

17:20.960 --> 17:22.439
excluding me.

17:22.879 --> 17:24.020
Is it His Majesty?

17:24.040 --> 17:25.120
That's right.

17:27.440 --> 17:27.760
By the way,

17:27.760 --> 17:31.320
I heard that Prime Minister Lin is going
to retire and return to his hometown.

17:31.559 --> 17:33.539
Yes. It'll happen in the next few days.

17:33.559 --> 17:35.079
That was quick.

17:37.280 --> 17:39.240
Everyone is getting old now.

17:39.919 --> 17:41.940
However, Prime Minister Lin
isn't the only official

17:41.960 --> 17:43.859
who had retired
and returned to his hometown

17:43.879 --> 17:46.359
in this period.

17:48.599 --> 17:49.919
Read it thoroughly.

17:50.000 --> 17:51.550
Devote yourself to the task.

17:52.800 --> 17:53.960
I'll be leaving now.

17:57.280 --> 17:58.299
You're leaving already?

17:58.319 --> 17:59.599
I'm busy.

18:03.879 --> 18:05.320
What does this mean?

18:07.240 --> 18:08.639
Is this a riddle?

18:25.420 --> 18:27.680
[Imperial Inspectorate Fifth Division
Black Cavalries Transfer Records]

18:27.680 --> 18:28.379
Mr. Fan,

18:28.399 --> 18:28.940
it's late now.

18:28.960 --> 18:30.400
You should have some supper.

18:31.800 --> 18:33.599
Say, what do you think this means?

18:33.910 --> 18:34.950
Is this another test?

18:34.970 --> 18:36.859
The transport of supplies
for the Black Cavalries

18:36.879 --> 18:38.879
is all managed by the First Division.

18:40.000 --> 18:41.819
Are you overthinking it?

18:41.839 --> 18:42.919
That won't be.

18:43.720 --> 18:45.919
I'm sure it's implying something else.

18:51.919 --> 18:53.639
I just can't figure it out.

18:54.079 --> 18:54.960
Say, why can't he

18:54.960 --> 18:56.639
just tell me the truth directly?

18:57.520 --> 18:58.740
Could it be

18:58.760 --> 19:01.359
that this is something
he can't disclose in public?

19:29.119 --> 19:30.199
Mr. Lin.

19:31.680 --> 19:32.760
Mr. Lin.

19:34.800 --> 19:37.359
Didn't we agree that
you shouldn't see me off?

19:37.399 --> 19:38.599
I need to hitch a ride.

19:38.879 --> 19:40.359
Where are you going?

19:40.720 --> 19:41.919
Just right ahead.

19:42.240 --> 19:43.579
What are you up to again?

19:43.599 --> 19:45.420
Mr. Lin, your departure from the Capital

19:45.440 --> 19:46.839
is too quiet, don't you think?

19:47.240 --> 19:48.740
When you hold a farewell,

19:48.760 --> 19:50.399
people cry about it.

19:50.520 --> 19:52.260
And, we have to drink before leaving.

19:52.280 --> 19:53.879
We have to recite poems too.

19:54.680 --> 19:57.679
It's exhausting.

19:59.200 --> 20:00.540
I'm old now.

20:00.560 --> 20:02.359
It's good to have some peace and quiet.

20:02.639 --> 20:03.839
Mr. Lin, don't worry.

20:03.960 --> 20:05.200
I don't do those things.

20:06.720 --> 20:08.439
Regarding Dabao...

20:09.399 --> 20:10.980
He loved the food in my residence.

20:11.000 --> 20:12.359
He gained some weight too.

20:13.760 --> 20:15.320
I'm glad to hear that.

20:15.919 --> 20:17.410
I'm glad to hear that.

20:17.430 --> 20:18.859
I didn't tell him that you were leaving

20:18.879 --> 20:20.299
as per your instruction.

20:20.319 --> 20:21.960
That's more like it.

20:22.520 --> 20:24.639
Let him be happy.

20:25.680 --> 20:27.639
Farewell isn't the happiest event.

20:28.680 --> 20:31.399
But I think you would like

20:32.440 --> 20:34.399
to see your family one last time

20:35.040 --> 20:36.480
before leaving the Capital.

21:06.110 --> 21:07.599
Please stop the carriage.

21:14.240 --> 21:15.320
Dabao.

21:16.599 --> 21:17.679
Wan'er!

21:18.000 --> 21:19.280
Wan'er, what's wrong?

21:19.399 --> 21:20.220
Wan'er!

21:20.240 --> 21:20.859
Wan'er!

21:20.879 --> 21:22.079
Wan'er, what's wrong?

21:22.839 --> 21:24.960
Let's kowtow in that direction.

21:27.440 --> 21:28.639
But why?

21:30.559 --> 21:31.960
I feel like doing it on a whim.

21:32.079 --> 21:33.520
Dabao, do it with me.

21:34.480 --> 21:35.639
I'll listen to you.

22:58.879 --> 23:00.980
I only told Dabao that
we were coming out for a stroll.

23:01.000 --> 23:02.550
I didn't tell him anything else.

23:07.000 --> 23:08.080
All right.

23:14.760 --> 23:16.159
But

23:17.480 --> 23:18.960
it must've been tough on you.

23:19.960 --> 23:21.800
Mr. Lin, I'll get off the carriage now.

23:25.159 --> 23:27.280
I wish you and Wan'er

23:28.919 --> 23:31.720
a blissful union.

23:35.440 --> 23:37.720
Safe travels.

23:47.800 --> 23:49.139
Little Xian!

23:49.159 --> 23:50.560
Little Xian!

23:51.520 --> 23:53.560
Little Xian!

23:56.599 --> 23:57.579
Little Xian!

23:57.599 --> 23:58.379
Little Xian!

23:58.399 --> 23:59.780
Little Xian! Let's go!

23:59.800 --> 24:00.960
Wan'er!

24:18.000 --> 24:19.960
It's already good enough
that he can retire

24:20.760 --> 24:22.240
and return to his hometown.

24:23.800 --> 24:25.359
What do you mean by good enough?

24:27.760 --> 24:30.439
It's good enough
for our family to stay together.

24:30.960 --> 24:31.980
We're a family.

24:32.000 --> 24:33.865
A family should stay together.

24:33.885 --> 24:34.859
No one should leave.

24:34.879 --> 24:36.740
Here, I'll give you two some hawthorns.

24:36.760 --> 24:38.159
Here, Little Xian.

24:43.520 --> 24:45.200
Wan'er, here you go.

24:46.839 --> 24:48.000
Thank you, Dabao.

25:01.080 --> 25:01.660
What's wrong?

25:01.680 --> 25:02.760
What's wrong?

25:03.240 --> 25:05.320
This hawthorn is so sour.

25:06.559 --> 25:08.800
If only Father was around.

25:14.119 --> 25:15.480
But it's fine.

25:15.520 --> 25:16.700
Father is very busy.

25:16.720 --> 25:18.099
We should play on our own,

25:18.119 --> 25:18.819
okay?

25:18.839 --> 25:19.859
Little Xian, let's go.

25:19.879 --> 25:21.800
Let's catch some butterflies. Come.

26:18.280 --> 26:19.020
Dabao.

26:19.040 --> 26:19.940
Play with me!

26:19.960 --> 26:21.399
Be careful!

26:22.319 --> 26:23.800
I want it to join me
in catching butterflies.

26:23.800 --> 26:25.760
It doesn't want to join me.

26:27.950 --> 26:28.919
If you don't want to join me,

26:28.919 --> 26:30.560
I'll play with someone else.

26:42.000 --> 26:43.119
What's wrong?

26:45.440 --> 26:47.099
I haven't managed to solve the riddle

26:47.119 --> 26:48.399
given to me by Mr. Chen.

26:49.839 --> 26:51.839
Master, why don't you take a look?

26:52.280 --> 26:53.599
The mobilization of the Black Cavalries?

26:53.599 --> 26:55.040
That's confidential.

26:56.680 --> 26:58.159
I'll skip.

26:59.280 --> 27:00.370
Why did he give it to you?

27:00.390 --> 27:03.270
The First Division has to allocate
supplies for the Black Cavalries.

27:09.800 --> 27:11.270
What did you say just now?

27:13.950 --> 27:15.500
The mobilization of the Black Cavalries?

27:15.520 --> 27:17.159
That's confidential.

27:21.800 --> 27:25.159
The Black Cavalries have always been
stationed outside the Capital.

27:25.200 --> 27:28.540
Here is a record of the resource allocation
over the years

27:28.560 --> 27:30.539
and the mobilization
of the Black Cavalries.

27:30.559 --> 27:32.040
Read it thoroughly.

27:32.960 --> 27:34.040
What's wrong?

27:37.760 --> 27:38.840
Nothing.

27:39.200 --> 27:39.820
You two go ahead.

27:39.840 --> 27:41.320
I'm reminded of something.

27:52.159 --> 27:53.239
Wang Qinian.

27:53.960 --> 27:55.330
Mr. Fan, are we heading back now?

27:55.350 --> 27:57.139
How many men
did you bring with us today?

27:57.159 --> 27:58.379
Only a few from the First Division.

27:58.399 --> 28:00.740
They're guarding the place.

28:00.760 --> 28:01.579
That's useless.

28:01.599 --> 28:02.679
What's wrong?

28:02.870 --> 28:05.379
Mr. Chen wants us to assist with
the transfer of supply and mobilization.

28:05.399 --> 28:06.120
That's right.

28:06.140 --> 28:08.299
If so, it's enough for this record
to contain the transfer records.

28:08.319 --> 28:10.790
Why does it also contain
the mobilization of the Black Cavalries?

28:10.879 --> 28:11.819
Is it because

28:11.839 --> 28:14.780
he wants you to take over
the Black Cavalries gradually?

28:14.800 --> 28:15.940
Do you have a horse?

28:15.960 --> 28:17.070
It's over there.

28:19.040 --> 28:20.520
Time does fly.

28:22.399 --> 28:24.399
Everyone is getting old now.

28:24.839 --> 28:26.980
However, Prime Minister Lin
isn't the only official

28:27.000 --> 28:31.060
who had retired and returned
to his hometown in this period.

28:31.080 --> 28:33.540
Which other important officials retired
and returned to their hometown?

28:33.559 --> 28:36.320
Other important officials?

28:36.839 --> 28:38.899
Mei Zhili, prefect of
the Capital Magistrate.

28:38.919 --> 28:39.600
You met him before.

28:39.620 --> 28:40.339
What happened to him?

28:40.359 --> 28:42.660
I heard that he was killed by bandits.

28:42.680 --> 28:43.780
Do you remember the date?

28:43.800 --> 28:44.780
I do.

28:44.800 --> 28:46.500
Check the mobilization on that date.

28:46.520 --> 28:47.919
It's on the 13th of June.

28:51.839 --> 28:54.660
The Black Cavalries were mobilized
on that day indeed.

28:54.680 --> 28:55.539
This can't be.

28:55.559 --> 28:57.139
There's one last important detail.

28:57.159 --> 28:59.119
The Black Cavalries

28:59.240 --> 29:00.859
isn't under the military's control.

29:00.879 --> 29:02.520
Only one person in the entire Qing State

29:02.520 --> 29:04.200
can mobilize the Black Cavalries

29:04.879 --> 29:06.399
excluding me.

29:06.720 --> 29:07.899
Could it be...

29:07.919 --> 29:08.760
His riddle

29:08.760 --> 29:09.920
is straight to the point indeed.

29:09.940 --> 29:11.630
Let's go. We need
to catch up to Mr. Lin.

29:17.190 --> 29:18.780
If we do encounter the Black Cavalries,

29:18.800 --> 29:20.159
we won't be able to stop them!

29:20.159 --> 29:20.919
This is an emergency.

29:20.919 --> 29:22.260
I have no time to get reinforcements!

29:22.280 --> 29:23.480
Let's give it a try!

29:49.240 --> 29:50.359
Your Highness?

29:52.079 --> 29:54.240
Isn't this Fan Xian? What a coincidence.

29:54.480 --> 29:55.760
What are you doing here?

29:56.010 --> 29:58.160
Wasn't I appointed as
the deputy commander of the palace guards?

29:58.180 --> 29:59.420
The Imperial Guards were lax.

29:59.440 --> 30:00.700
I brought them out to train them.

30:00.720 --> 30:01.539
Over here?

30:01.559 --> 30:02.620
Mr. Chen arranged for it.

30:02.640 --> 30:04.059
We're talking about the Imperial Guards.

30:04.079 --> 30:05.839
It's not easy to find a free day.

30:06.119 --> 30:07.539
He's something else.

30:07.559 --> 30:08.639
What's wrong?

30:09.079 --> 30:10.099
Your Highness,

30:10.119 --> 30:12.399
do you dare to make a risky deal?

30:12.680 --> 30:14.460
That sounds thrilling.

30:14.480 --> 30:16.059
We might have to face
the Black Cavalries.

30:16.079 --> 30:17.020
I know nothing.

30:17.040 --> 30:18.270
You were the one who abducted him.

30:18.290 --> 30:19.980
We're short on time.
There's no time for explanation.

30:20.000 --> 30:21.080
Follow me.

31:47.050 --> 31:48.470
[Inspector]

32:24.599 --> 32:25.819
Hello, everyone.

32:25.839 --> 32:27.240
It must've been tough.

32:27.520 --> 32:28.899
Let me introduce them.

32:28.919 --> 32:31.379
These are the Imperial Guards.

32:31.399 --> 32:32.539
And him.

32:32.559 --> 32:33.619
This is First Prince.

32:33.639 --> 32:35.720
He leads troops
at the border area all year long.

32:35.760 --> 32:37.839
He's at least a prince.

32:38.680 --> 32:39.819
At least a prince?

32:39.839 --> 32:41.079
And him too.

32:41.440 --> 32:42.760
That's Wang Qinian.

32:44.720 --> 32:45.260
Mr. Fan,

32:45.280 --> 32:47.020
it's pointless for you to introduce me.

32:47.040 --> 32:48.800
His Qinggong is excellent.

32:48.940 --> 32:50.320
No one can catch up to him.

32:51.159 --> 32:53.480
Guys, please go easy on me later.

32:56.559 --> 32:58.480
We have the Imperial Guards, a prince,

32:58.480 --> 33:00.960
and a top Qinggong practitioner here.

33:02.200 --> 33:03.919
It's hard to silence us.

33:05.800 --> 33:06.940
Why don't we make a deal?

33:06.960 --> 33:08.480
Let's each take a step back

33:08.559 --> 33:09.839
and go home.

33:10.000 --> 33:11.180
If anyone asks you about it,

33:11.200 --> 33:12.370
you can use that.

33:12.390 --> 33:14.099
I'll bear all of the responsibilities.

33:14.119 --> 33:15.359
Do we have a deal here?

33:15.440 --> 33:16.859
Are you Fan Xian?

33:16.879 --> 33:17.959
That is me.

33:18.000 --> 33:20.020
The Black Cavalries
cannot leave the camp

33:20.040 --> 33:22.280
unless they're ordered to do so.

33:22.359 --> 33:23.660
Since I'm here,

33:23.680 --> 33:25.280
that means I'm under an order.

33:25.359 --> 33:27.320
Inspector Fan, you should know

33:27.520 --> 33:29.200
that military orders are absolute.

33:30.280 --> 33:32.000
That means the deal is off, huh?

33:48.839 --> 33:50.030
Keep your weapons.

33:54.680 --> 33:56.599
Your words are a bit disjointed here.

33:57.119 --> 33:58.580
Didn't you say
each of us should go home?

33:58.600 --> 34:00.180
Didn't you say
military orders were absolute?

34:00.200 --> 34:02.946
The Black Cavalries are under
the Fifth Division.

34:02.966 --> 34:05.500
This time, we mobilized the team
under the Fifth Division's order.

34:05.520 --> 34:07.500
Inspector Fan, your rank

34:07.520 --> 34:09.880
is only below Mr. Chen's
in the Imperial Inspectorate.

34:10.039 --> 34:12.399
Your order is superior
to that of the Fifth Division.

34:12.640 --> 34:14.339
Therefore, going home

34:14.359 --> 34:15.720
is our order.

34:17.240 --> 34:18.320
Thank you.

34:18.830 --> 34:20.160
This is a military order.

34:23.399 --> 34:24.630
Return to the camp!

34:41.670 --> 34:43.940
[Commander Jing,
commander of the Black Cavalries]

35:03.640 --> 35:05.600
Do you need anything else?

35:12.200 --> 35:14.345
[God of Poetry]

35:15.839 --> 35:17.559
Inspector, I heard about your death.

35:18.439 --> 35:19.839
I bought it overnight.

35:20.399 --> 35:21.680
Well...

35:22.200 --> 35:23.760
Should I thank you?

35:24.760 --> 35:26.439
Luckily, it was just a rumor.

35:28.710 --> 35:29.899
Why don't I pay you back for the book?

35:29.919 --> 35:31.030
No need for that.

35:33.640 --> 35:35.200
Inspector, can you

35:36.280 --> 35:37.680
give me your signature?

35:42.879 --> 35:44.379
I didn't bring any brush with me.

35:44.399 --> 35:45.519
Do you have a brush?

35:45.680 --> 35:46.839
Don't look at me.

35:49.270 --> 35:50.339
What are you doing?

35:50.359 --> 35:51.919
Blood can serve as ink as well.

35:52.120 --> 35:53.200
Here's a brush.

35:55.640 --> 35:57.240
We have a brush here.

36:08.919 --> 36:11.479
But we don't have any ink.

36:19.600 --> 36:21.439
We need water to grind ink.

36:22.319 --> 36:23.459
I don't think tea will work.

36:23.479 --> 36:25.060
At least it's better than blood.

36:25.080 --> 36:26.359
You do have a point.

36:46.680 --> 36:47.919
Mr. Fan, go ahead.

36:56.439 --> 36:58.240
Well, you two are blocking the light.

37:03.000 --> 37:04.280
I should write it to you.

37:04.960 --> 37:06.580
I'm not telling you to throw up.
[*"To" and "throw up" are homonyms]

37:06.600 --> 37:07.939
I'm going to write your name on it.

37:07.959 --> 37:09.379
It's for you.

37:09.399 --> 37:10.519
That's great.

37:11.999 --> 37:12.819
What's your surname?

37:12.839 --> 37:13.660
Jing.

37:13.680 --> 37:14.540
Jing as in thorns?

37:14.560 --> 37:14.980
That's right.

37:15.000 --> 37:16.359
That's a great surname.

37:16.680 --> 37:17.499
Your name?

37:17.519 --> 37:18.299
None.

37:18.319 --> 37:19.339
Jing None?

37:19.359 --> 37:20.559
That's a great name.

37:20.919 --> 37:21.939
My name isn't None.

37:21.959 --> 37:23.559
I don't have a name.

37:37.190 --> 37:38.379
What about your position?

37:38.399 --> 37:39.170
Deputy commander.

37:39.190 --> 37:40.840
Subordinate of the Fifth Division.

37:42.560 --> 37:44.080
All right.

37:52.319 --> 37:53.399
Deputy...

37:54.399 --> 37:55.479
Deputy...

38:11.325 --> 38:13.245
[To Commander Jing, Fan Xian]

38:17.919 --> 38:19.140
My handwriting isn't good.

38:19.160 --> 38:20.459
You're too modest.

38:20.479 --> 38:22.019
It's no wonder Mr. Chen said

38:22.039 --> 38:23.380
your handwriting

38:23.400 --> 38:25.190
shocks both deities and ghosts alike.

38:28.760 --> 38:29.500
Thank you.

38:29.520 --> 38:30.919
Commander Jing,
do you like to read poems?

38:30.920 --> 38:32.180
I know nothing about poetry,

38:32.200 --> 38:33.399
but I like them.

38:34.520 --> 38:36.859
The literary field of the Qing State
has been weak for a long time.

38:36.879 --> 38:38.339
Inspector, your appearance

38:38.359 --> 38:39.999
is truly a blessing for our state.

38:40.200 --> 38:41.959
Even if I don't understand poetry,

38:42.519 --> 38:44.160
I'm still impressed by you.

38:46.080 --> 38:47.240
Inspector Fan,

38:48.879 --> 38:50.439
I'm glad to see you alive.

38:52.519 --> 38:53.600
I feel the same.

39:23.519 --> 39:24.680
It's time

39:24.800 --> 39:26.640
for you to practice your handwriting.

39:27.359 --> 39:29.320
Mr. Lin, I'll send you back
to your hometown.

39:31.240 --> 39:32.770
I was mistaken.

39:32.790 --> 39:33.939
Mistaken about what?

39:33.959 --> 39:35.750
The appearance of the Black Cavalries,

39:36.600 --> 39:38.200
what do you think that means?

39:38.310 --> 39:40.080
His Majesty was trying to kill you.

39:40.399 --> 39:41.519
You're wrong.

39:42.120 --> 39:45.600
His Majesty isn't trying
to replace the prime minister.

39:46.439 --> 39:49.160
He's trying to abolish the position.

39:49.240 --> 39:50.760
What's the difference?

39:52.190 --> 39:53.479
Abolish the position?

39:54.320 --> 39:56.379
So he intends to abolish
the position of prime minister?

39:56.399 --> 39:57.740
I made the wrong judgment.

39:57.760 --> 40:01.320
Therefore, I used
the wrong countermeasure.

40:02.399 --> 40:03.720
Wait here.

40:09.439 --> 40:10.919
This name list includes

40:10.999 --> 40:14.559
the names of all my proteges
and acquaintances.

40:14.839 --> 40:16.740
Hand it to His Majesty.

40:16.760 --> 40:18.640
After that, tell His Majesty

40:19.010 --> 40:20.899
that I will submit
a memorial to the throne

40:20.919 --> 40:22.680
once I return to my hometown.

40:23.439 --> 40:26.120
The memorial will state
the cons of the position.

40:26.280 --> 40:27.350
As the leader of all officials,

40:27.370 --> 40:29.150
the prime minister has too much power.

40:29.519 --> 40:31.379
If a sly individual were
to assume the position,

40:31.399 --> 40:33.320
the state will be placed in danger.

40:33.360 --> 40:35.780
I'll be the one initiating
the abolishment of the position.

40:35.800 --> 40:37.590
It has nothing to do with His Majesty.

40:38.280 --> 40:39.170
All right now.

40:39.190 --> 40:40.840
You should return to the Capital.

40:41.720 --> 40:43.379
I should escort you for some time.

40:43.399 --> 40:44.680
That'll be unnecessary.

40:45.640 --> 40:47.220
I'll be fine

40:47.240 --> 40:48.620
once you deliver the name list

40:48.640 --> 40:51.280
and my message to His Majesty.

40:51.360 --> 40:53.550
The Black Cavalries
were here to kill you, you know?

40:54.160 --> 40:55.959
They weren't here to kill me.

40:57.080 --> 40:58.770
They were here to serve as a reminder.

40:58.790 --> 40:59.999
Are you that confident in yourself?

40:59.999 --> 41:01.339
Are you sure
they weren't here to kill you?

41:01.359 --> 41:03.080
I won't die.

41:03.600 --> 41:05.280
I'm afraid all of these servants

41:05.879 --> 41:08.120
have to die.

41:09.560 --> 41:11.280
I'm not Mei Zhili.

41:11.919 --> 41:13.559
If I die now,

41:14.206 --> 41:15.606
they won't be able

41:16.439 --> 41:18.080
to record the history of the state.

41:25.360 --> 41:27.120
If His Majesty wanted to remind you,

41:27.160 --> 41:28.700
he could've told you in public.

41:28.720 --> 41:30.280
Why did he need to resort to this?

41:30.720 --> 41:32.640
Do I need to explain it to you?

41:33.919 --> 41:35.439
It serves both as a reminder

41:36.359 --> 41:37.760
and a threat.

41:38.240 --> 41:41.959
What do you think about
His Majesty's means?

41:42.240 --> 41:44.020
His Majesty's means are unpredictable.

41:44.040 --> 41:45.525
His methods are ingenious.

41:45.600 --> 41:47.240
Ingenious?

41:47.519 --> 41:50.919
It's not that impressive.

41:51.640 --> 41:53.080
If you command the Six Ministries

41:53.080 --> 41:54.499
and wield control over the army,

41:54.519 --> 41:57.220
you can be as ingenious as him.

41:57.240 --> 41:59.019
You shouldn't say that loudly.

41:59.039 --> 42:01.839
The rarest thing about His Majesty

42:02.319 --> 42:06.720
is that no one can tell
what he'll do next.

42:06.839 --> 42:08.170
During your dispute with Chengze,

42:08.190 --> 42:10.010
His Majesty took advantage
of the situation.

42:10.030 --> 42:12.220
That's why you two were able
to compete during the spring exam.

42:12.240 --> 42:14.720
After that, it led to
the spring exam corruption cases.

42:14.919 --> 42:16.120
From that,

42:16.280 --> 42:18.479
it led to my resignation.

42:18.999 --> 42:24.160
Thus, His Majesty achieved his goal
of abolishing the prime minister.

42:24.830 --> 42:27.180
His Majesty leveraged his strength
to achieve his goals.

42:27.200 --> 42:30.919
All of his intentions were hidden.

42:31.959 --> 42:34.839
Fan Xian, you must remember this.

42:35.200 --> 42:38.479
Never trust His Majesty completely.

42:38.839 --> 42:40.459
You mustn't think that
you've seen through him

42:40.479 --> 42:44.800
until the very last second.

42:47.640 --> 42:49.080
You are saying this

42:49.879 --> 42:51.919
as if I compete with His Majesty.

42:53.439 --> 42:56.919
That's not up to you.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
